## 📌 Overview
Mothers carry the vast majority of unpaid household labor, managing family budgets, meal preparation, and cost calculations under constant time pressure. **MumWise** provides compassionate, practical financial and grocery budgeting tools without restrictive spreadsheets or food guilt.

---

## 🚀 Key Features
* **Smart Grocery Swaps**: Upload or describe name-brand products to discover affordable, high-quality alternatives.
* **Batch Cooking Calculator**: Calculate true cost-per-serving across family recipes to slash grocery bills and eliminate food waste.
* **Renovation Savings Guide**: Clear breakdowns comparing DIY vs. professional contractor costs.
* **Beginner Investment Guide**: Accessible, zero-jargon asset allocation tailored to user risk tolerance.
* **RevenueCat Monetization**: Auto-renewing Pro/Premium subscriptions and universal credit packs.

