## 🛠 Tech Stack & Architecture
* **Frontend**: Flutter / Dart with custom tab views, `fl_chart`, and `image_picker`
* **Monetization Engine**: RevenueCat SDK (`purchases_flutter`)
* **Backend API**: Python REST API on Azure Web Apps (`https://mum-hdfvdudvdgaydvdg.eastus-01.azurewebsites.net`)
* **Vision & NLP**: Multi-modal Gemini analysis endpoints

---

## 📂 Project Structure
```text
mumwise/
├── android/               # Native Android configuration
├── ios/                   # Native iOS configuration
├── lib/
│   ├── main.dart          # App entry, state management, RevenueCat configure
│   ├── models/            # UserSession, ExpenseEntry, FinancialGoal
│   ├── services/          # ApiService (Shopping swaps, batch cooking, Azure endpoints)
│   └── screens/           # HomeScreen, MoneySaversScreen, InvestmentScreen, AIAssistantScreen, UpgradeScreen
├── azure_mu/              # Azure backend infrastructure
│   ├── app.py             # REST endpoints
│   ├── users.db           # SQLite database
│   └── requirements.txt   # Python dependencies
└── pubspec.yaml           # Flutter dependencies
```

---

## ⚙️ Getting Started
```bash
git clone https://github.com/Jerryblessed/mumwise.git
cd mumwise
flutter pub get
flutter run
```

